  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "The original population is \\(12\\) students. If it doubles, the new population is\n\n\\[\n2(12)=24.\n\\]\n\nThe percentage increase is\n\n\\[\n\\frac{24-12}{12}\\times 100\\%\n=\\frac{12}{12}\\times 100\\%\n=100\\%.\n\\]\n\nThus, the percentage increase when the population doubles is\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{100\\%}.\n\\]\n\n(Note: Under the stated monthly rule, the population actually triples from \\(12\\) to \\(36\\), which would be a \\(200\\%\\) increase.)",
    "The original population is \\(12\\) students. After one month, it doubles:\n\n\\[\n12 \\times 2 = 24.\n\\]\n\nThe increase is\n\n\\[\n24-12=12.\n\\]\n\nRelative to the original population, the percentage increase is\n\n\\[\n\\frac{12}{12}\\times 100\\%=100\\%.\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{100\\%}\n\\]",
